The host mounts a 720 by 430 canvas in a section shadow root containing a 760 by 445 pane.
The pane has zero margins and visible overflow. Only the contents control sets display: contents and overflow: hidden.
The supplied Review and Publish positions are (24,14) and (330,236). Selected node is Review, or Publish for capture.
Static clip surrounds the canvas from start. Capture changes the class in document capture of a trusted Enter click.
Playwright supplies keyboard input. Full CDP Accessibility.getFullAXTree is filtered to the two native node buttons.
The log retains the complete application request stream for each case and the trust of the most recent browser input.

