Synchronous browser hit-testing experiment
Transient transparent aria-hidden SVG rect appended inside the map with pointer-events=all.
It covers the action bounds expanded by four pixels for the fixture outline. Map inverse converts client points to SVG coordinates.
ShadowRoot.elementFromPoint probes center, top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right, one pixel in from the probe edges.
The temporary rect is removed in the same input turn and sits above the canvas faces during the probe.
The temporary hit target bypasses local paint order and samples a finite number of points.
